ent-RMCPropTyrargoVehicleVTOL = AD-71E VTOL
    .desc = A twin tilt-jet VTOL, the Blackfoot is the Bearcat's ugly big sister. For what she lacks in fire power and agility, she more than makes up for in utility and love handles. First tested by UN Northridge on United Nations soil, the Blackfoot is currently undergoing active combat trials. This craft appears to be undergoing maintenance and is not ready to fly.
ent-RMCPropTyrargoVehicleVTOLCrashed = AD-71E VTOL
    .desc = A twin tilt-jet VTOL, the Blackfoot is the Bearcat's ugly big sister. For what she lacks in fire power and agility, she more than makes up for in utility and love handles. First tested by UN Northridge on United Nations soil, the Blackfoot is currently undergoing active combat trials. This craft appears to have crash landed, and is inoperable.
    .suffix = Crashed
ent-RMCPropTyrargoVehicleEvacBlack = F-44 Aerospace fighter
    .desc = A high tech, silver coated F-44 aerospace fighter used by the UNMC in deep recon missions. The thermal-absorbent paint alone probably costs more than your squad's collective paycheck. Unfortunately however, this jet was in the middle of a repair cycle when the northern defences were breached, necessitating an evacuation.
    .suffix = Black
ent-RMCPropTyrargoVehicleEvacGreen = F-44 Aerospace fighter
    .desc = A state of the art F-44 aerospace fighter used by the UNMC. This fighter has seen better days with extensive internal wiring damage and unfinished repairs to the bomb-bays.
    .suffix = Green
ent-RMCPropTyrargoVehicleTruck = M887 Truck
    .desc = A small box-type van. It's a compact vehicle with a rectangular cargo area, typically designed for transporting goods or small equipment. It features a high roof and straight sides, providing ample vertical space for storage. Its size makes it maneuverable and ideal for urban driving and tight spaces. This van appears to be non-functional, likely due to excessive use during the recent outbreak.
