ent-RMCPropTyrargoVehicleATV = BISON Automated Transport Vehicle
    .desc = The BISON ATV is an remote-controlled logistical supply vehicle, intended to assist UNMC rear-line logistics forces in moving supplies. It requires someone to be standing near it for the auto-pilot functions to work. This model is non-functional.
