ent-RMCPropTyrargoVehicleIFV = M34 Marshal IFV
    .desc = Developed by Weston-Yamada, the RAT (Rover Armed Transport) was originally designed for the TSE military as an armed version of their RT series of expeditionary vehicles, being instead adopted by the UN Marine Corps. It's heavier and and more durable then the M570 series the Marines use, as they don't have a need for APCs capable of being transported via a dropship.
ent-RMCPropTyrargoVehicleHalfTrack = M255 Armored Half-Track
    .desc = A UN half-track, used everywhere in the Marine Corps. Comes in multiple different configurations, from being able to haul troops to mounting a mobile mortar. Versatile and cheap. This one appears to be non-functional due to overuse during the recent outbreak.
